*unpack* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''unpack(bytes)''

Converts bytes to a string.

*Parameters:*
- ''bytes'': Bytes to convert

*Returns:*
- String: String representation of the bytes

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if argument is not bytes

*Notes:*
This performs a raw bytes-to-string conversion without UTF-8 validation.
